[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7680.47, "timestamp": "02:08:00", "text": "えっと、それはただ自然にやってくるんだと思います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7682.95, "timestamp": "02:08:02", "text": "当然、ゲームをたくさんプレイすればそうなる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7683.83, "timestamp": "02:08:03", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7684.87, "timestamp": "02:08:04", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7688.069, "timestamp": "02:08:08", "text": "うーん、それはとても嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7700.069, "timestamp": "02:08:20", "text": "でも、そうですね、つまり、始めると"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7701.589, "timestamp": "02:08:21", "text": "少し難しくなるので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7702.709, "timestamp": "02:08:22", "text": "それについてあまり心配しすぎないでください。うん。また、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7703.35, "timestamp": "02:08:23", "text": "どうしたの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7705.669, "timestamp": "02:08:25", "text": "あと、えっと、映画とか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7707.83, "timestamp": "02:08:27", "text": "ダンジョンズ＆ドラゴンズ関連の何か？聞くところによると"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7708.31, "timestamp": "02:08:28", "text": "これ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7709.83, "timestamp": "02:08:29", "text": "ダンジョンズ＆ドラゴンズの映画がある。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7711.35, "timestamp": "02:08:31", "text": "でも、それは見ていないんです。わからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7712.629, "timestamp": "02:08:32", "text": "中身は何ですか。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7713.189, "timestamp": "02:08:33", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7725.35, "timestamp": "02:08:45", "text": "わかった。現在更新中です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7727.43, "timestamp": "02:08:47", "text": "呪文を更新する、例えばすべての"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7729.75, "timestamp": "02:08:49", "text": "それの。ええ、それから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7731.91, "timestamp": "02:08:51", "text": "呪文を準備するようなものです。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7733.43, "timestamp": "02:08:53", "text": "えっと、これから説明していきますね"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7735.382, "timestamp": "02:08:55", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hru"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7735.99, "timestamp": "02:08:55", "text": "それ。それで、呪文タブに移動すると"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7738.149, "timestamp": "02:08:58", "text": "キャラクターシートには、"}]